astebin or a chat attachment: a code snippet, a config file, an HTML mockup, a markdown note. Anything you want to hand to someone as a single link."],"features":["In-browser editor. Create and edit files in a multi-file editor with a sidebar, or drop in existing files from disk. Text, images, and binary files are all supported.","Live preview. Markdown, images, and even multi-file HTML/CSS/JS projects render in a sandboxed preview pane.","Three sharing modes:","Public: a plain link; anyone who has it can open it.","Password: the payload is encrypted with AES-256-GCM, using a key derived from your password with Argon2id."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/noppa/linkify.ink/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3b8d10a3e0d26db37fe00570ec8376e58d595945249cf38800c1a9fcb0851f4e","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:09.520Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:09.520Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"linkify.ink packs files into a compressed, optionally encrypted payload and encodes the whole thing into a URL. There's no upload, no storage bucket, no account, and no expiry date. Anyone who opens the link gets the files decoded right in their browser. Browsers don't send the part of a URL after # to the server, so linkify.ink never sees your files: they exist only in the links you share and the browsers that open them.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/noppa/linkify.ink/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"There's no upload, no storage bucket, no account, and no expiry date.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/noppa/linkify.ink/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3b8d10a3e0d26db37fe00570ec8376e58d595945249cf38800c1a9fcb0851f4e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/noppa/linkify.ink/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:09.521Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T08:30:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/noppa/linkify.ink/blob/main/README.md"